The universal proof now closes with `#Top`: the active-frame claim supplies induction on `s[3:]`, and the top-level claim proves the actual function call returns the recursive code-sequence specification for every symbolic input. I’m moving to the required LLVM compile and concrete `krun` suite, then I’ll make `prove.sh` reproduce both paths from scratch.
